# Run 385 evidence archive — only README.md, summary.txt, and .gitignore are tracked.
# Everything else here is CI-artifact-only or per-run temporary output and MUST NOT be committed.
# In particular the generated RELEASE_ARTIFACT_MANIFEST.json is a CI *artifact* (uploaded by
# .github/workflows/public-devnet-release-artifact-manifest.yml), never a committed changing file.
# Node data dirs, node logs, raw /metrics scrape dumps, the staged ci-artifacts/ bundle, and the
# generated manifest are temporary and dev/CI-only; only publish-safe hashes and status lines appear in
# the tracked summary/README. The committed, publish-safe example manifest lives at
# docs/release/public-devnet/binary/RELEASE_ARTIFACT_MANIFEST.example.json.
ci-artifacts/
run384/
node-data/
nodes/
logs/
data/
RELEASE_ARTIFACT_MANIFEST.json
manifest.json
qbind-node.sha256
BUILDID.txt
MANIFEST_VALIDATION_SUMMARY.txt
clean_metrics.txt
metrics.txt
*.metrics
*.err
*.log
*.metrics.txt
manifest.metrics.txt